    name: 'Wendy Alsup',
    tagline: 'Author & Bible teacher on theology for women',
    focusWomen: true,
    bio: "Wendy Alsup is an author and Bible teacher who writes on applying core theology directly to women's everyday lives and struggles, with a particular focus on identity, healing, and the practical implications of the gospel. A former math teacher, she brings a methodical, first-principles approach to explaining doctrine for a lay audience.\n\nHer books Practical Theology for Women and The Gospel-Centered Woman both work through foundational Christian doctrine — the nature of God, sin, and the gospel — showing how each shapes a woman's daily identity and choices, while By His Wounds You Are Healed applies the book of Ephesians to a woman's sense of worth and healing.",
