    name: 'Trillia Newbell',
    tagline: 'Author & speaker on faith, diversity & women\'s discipleship',
    focusWomen: true,
    bio: "Trillia Newbell is an author and speaker who writes on identity in Christ, racial diversity in the church, and the everyday fears and hardships women face, drawing on both Scripture and her own experience as a Black woman in predominantly white evangelical spaces. Her books are typically short, accessible, and structured around a single theme worked out over a handful of chapters.\n\nUnited addresses racial division within the church as a gospel issue, Fear and Faith walks through different fears women commonly face, Enjoy explores the freedom to enjoy God's good gifts without guilt, and Sacred Endurance offers shorter devotional reflections on faith through hardship.",
