    bio: "David Jeremiah is the senior pastor of Shadow Mountain Community Church in El Cajon, California, and the founder of Turning Point, a media ministry broadcasting his teaching on television and radio. He has authored dozens of books over a ministry career spanning more than five decades, many focused on biblical prophecy and the end times.\n\nBooks like Agents of the Apocalypse, Agents of Babylon, and The Book of Signs walk through prophetic passages in Daniel and Revelation, translating complex prophetic material into accessible, hope-focused teaching. His more recent titles, including Where Do We Go From Here? and The World of the End, apply that same framework to interpreting contemporary cultural and political change.",
