    bio: "Max Lucado is a pastor and author who has served at Oak Hills Church in San Antonio, Texas, for decades. Known for his warm, accessible writing style, he has published more than a hundred books over his career, many becoming national bestsellers.\n\nHis adult nonfiction, including titles like In the Grip of Grace, Anxious for Nothing, and Facing Your Giants, focuses on grace, anxiety, and God's steady presence amid life's struggles. He's also written a long-running line of illustrated children's books, beginning with You Are Special in 1997, introducing his storytelling to generations of young readers alongside his adult audience.",
