    bio: "Levi Lusko is the pastor of Fresh Life Church, a multi-site church he leads with his wife, Jennie, based in Montana. His writing and ministry took on a distinctly personal focus following the sudden death of his five-year-old daughter, Lenya, in 2012.\n\nBooks like Through the Eyes of a Lion and Blessed Are the Spiraling grew directly out of that loss, addressing grief, doubt, and rebuilding faith with unusual candor for the genre. His other books, including I Declare War and Swipe Right, extend that same direct, personal-story-driven style to topics like internal struggle, habits, and relationships.",
