    tagline: 'Founder of Joyce Meyer Ministries',
    bio: "Joyce Meyer is the founder of Joyce Meyer Ministries, based in Missouri, and one of the most widely read Christian authors of the past three decades, with tens of millions of books sold. Her teaching draws heavily on her own recovery from childhood sexual abuse, which she has spoken and written about extensively as part of her message on emotional healing.\n\nHer best-known book, Battlefield of the Mind, focuses on identifying and replacing negative, defeating thought patterns and has sold millions of copies since its 1990s release, spawning an entire 'Battlefield' series. Her broader catalog, including Beauty for Ashes and Healing the Soul of a Woman, continues to focus on practical, application-driven teaching aimed at emotional and spiritual recovery.",
