    bio: "John MacArthur (born 1939) has served as pastor of Grace Community Church in Sun Valley, California, since 1969, and is known internationally through his Grace to You radio and media ministry. Over several decades he wrote the multi-volume MacArthur New Testament Commentary, eventually covering nearly every book of the New Testament verse by verse.\n\nHis commentaries — spanning volumes on Matthew, Romans, Hebrews, and Revelation, among others — reflect his expository, verse-by-verse preaching style and a strongly Reformed, dispensational theological framework, and are widely used by pastors preparing sermons across evangelical and Reformed Baptist circles.",
