    name: 'R.C. Sproul',
    tagline: 'Founder of Ligonier Ministries',
    bio: "R.C. Sproul (1939–2017) was an American Reformed theologian and pastor who founded Ligonier Ministries and taught for years through its Renewing Your Mind radio program. Though best known for his teaching on the holiness of God and Reformed theology broadly, he also produced a series of expository commentaries drawn from his pulpit ministry at Saint Andrew's Chapel in Sanford, Florida.\n\nHis St. Andrew's Expositional Commentary series — including volumes on Romans, John, and Acts — reflects his conversational, theologically precise preaching style, walking through each book with an emphasis on the character of God and the doctrines of grace.",
